1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:12,040
I cannot allow you before Théoden
King so armed, Gandalf Greyhame.

2
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:16,000
By order of Gríma Wormtongue.

3
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,000
Your staff.

4
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:22,880
You would not part an old
man from his walking stick?

5
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,600
He's a herald of woe.

6
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:42,600
The courtesy of your hall is somewhat
lessened of late, Théoden King.

7
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,200
He's not welcome.

8
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:50,600
Why should I welcome you,

9
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:54,880
Gandalf Stormcrow?

10
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:58,400
A just question, my liege.

11
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:08,680
I will draw you, Saruman,
as poison is drawn from a wound.

12
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:18,400
If I go, Théoden dies.

13
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:23,480
You did not kill me, you will not kill him!

14
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,480
Rohan is mine!

15
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:32,000
Be gone!
